## Changelog:

2.0.0:
    - Added optional `--debug` flag for better logging
    - Improved logging
        - added more detailed logs for debugging
        - hid logs useless to the end user behind debug
    - simplified user installation
        - automated creation of venv
        - automated installation of project requirements into the venv
        - added `--warmup` flag to just warm the app up without doing anything else
    - added simple database to keep track of downloaded video's
    - updated README.md to accurately reflect the current state of the tool
    - improved building with automatic building script `build.py` (use with `python .\build.py`)
1.0.2 - fixed bug where master playlist extraction can fail due to unexpected url format
1.0.1:
    - added functionality to set custom output directory
    - dynamically get extension based on codec in master playlist
    - checks if file already exists
    - removed useless concatenation progress
1.0.0 - initial release